{"environment":{},"event_id":"sha256:63b02ed3758f4c7ef5ff29eeec64d394d78e30f630f0a9f0c2a7d41f2ac8c1dd","observations":[{"diagnostic":{"error_signature":"sha256:890b63628cf9471681cdf450f4d44cf2dd228bce79e191720473e2b3a341ab55","error_tail":"cannot modify \"<private-path>\": file has not been read — read the file, then retry\nError: cannot modify \"<private-path>\": file has not been read — read the file, then retry","seq":1,"tool_name":"write","type":"tool_failure"},"kind":"diagnostic","source_ref":"sha256:7888e692eb4d152746fa63c9189f261eb3768b5371ae2ce88c83df33058f2b59"},{"action":{"path":"launch-verification.sh","seq":2,"tool_name":"write","type":"file_write"},"kind":"executed_action","source_ref":"sha256:a0d46885eca5357480e98846608eb6adbd70a60bb8e89e860f9a191e5a668e52"},{"digest":"sha256:5e36c3f1e21fca4531ece61d6e4b69d04e55b36c6f0b8f2f8c548f0abeb64250","kind":"agent_note","note":{"content":{"learned":"在 exec 前加 export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$native_dir${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"：前置目录、不留空分量；换库时按该库自身 site-packages/<pkg> 重定位 native_dir 再传参，用原命令复跑。","what":"验证启动脚本收了原生库目录参数却不导出 LD_LIBRARY_PATH，子进程环境为空，依赖 libapriltag.so 的导入仍报 Error loading shared library，3 项启动测试全败。","where":"来源档案 am-347d912831feb751855892df（migbot-experience-raw），固定提交 343c60fd2309dbf1edf6d3169b80838c54e1f1cd；apriltag-python 3.4.5。","why":"musl 只按动态链接器搜索路径解析 DT_NEEDED，且 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 仅在进程启动时读一次；父 shell 不导出则 python 内赋值、RTLD_GLOBAL 预加载都无效。"},"fix":{"diff":"--- a/launch-verification.sh\n+++ b/launch-verification.sh\n@@ -2,4 +2,5 @@\n set -euo pipefail\n native_dir=$1\n shift\n+export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$native_dir${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"\n exec \"$@\"\n","kind":"diff"},"scope":"global","title":"apriltag-python 启动脚本未导出原生库目录致子进程加载失败","topic_key":"harmony/native-loader-launch","type":"bugfix"},"source_ref":"sha256:d671e2b4aa478dfdde0144f09925a830bc7f2fb7dca1953371bd128251b59692","trust":"untrusted_raw"},{"diagnostic":{"error_signature":"sha256:890b63628cf9471681cdf450f4d44cf2dd228bce79e1